<title>UK: Dresdner Finance adds 200 bln lire to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Finance adds 200 bln lire to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by 200 billion lire to 500 billion lire, joint lead managers Banca Nazionale del Lavoro, Banca Commerciale Italiana and Bear Stearns said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    *500 BLN LIRE COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    20.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.58    PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL 200 BLN LIRE LAUNCHED 19.NOV.96, INCREASED</p>
<p>		 BY 100 BLN LIRE 20.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	**US/UK/IT/NL/DE WITH PREVIOUS CONSULTATION WITH</p>
<p>		  ISSUER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
